From 5aa5ce738f95bd39cacbe96c792b5ecf1805a042 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpv_tc <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 07:20:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] decklink: allow changing the mirror at runtime, add menu
 entry

--decklink-* options now take effect at runtime: the mirror is recreated
on the VO thread and immediately shows the current frame. The new
decklink-devices property lists the output devices; select.lua gets a
'DeckLink output' menu entry that sets --decklink-mirror and remembers the
choice in ~~/decklink.state for the next start.
